+# p2mr-ts rescue vectors
+
+`p2mr_ts_rescue.json` is a copy, byte for byte, of `vectors/m4r/rescue.json` of p2mr-ts, the
+TypeScript P2MR library, from its support for the M4-R rescue lane, at p2mr-ts commit `31e737d`, which
+is not published yet (git tree `c3746e85…`; its `docs/C-R3-REPORT.md` says how the vectors were
+made). p2mr-ts computed the network ids, the BIP 341
+single hashes, the rescue signature messages, the key commitment and `m` with its own code,
+independently of this code base; the two proofs in the annexes were made over regtest's `m` by the
+Python prover of ark0-rescue (commit `273f11b`, SPEC v0.2 revision 2, statement 0x01).
+
+| File | SHA-256 |
+|---|---|
+| `p2mr_ts_rescue.json` | `68197471e11f9351b3096fae010d37cc142ada61fd5915dc104351ee3a6a5bc9` |
+
+The copy is replaced only on purpose, together with this hash.
+`src/test/p2mr_rescue_tests.cpp` (`p2mr_ts_vectors`) checks it.
